msgstr "Краткий апокрифический том, созданный, вероятно, Эдемом для ведения записей.<br><br>Копии того же апокрифа «Эдемский гимн» можно обменять на особое снаряжение."

#. ja: 共鳴の断章:第4片
#. de: Viertes Fragment des Edenchor-Kodex
#. fr: Codex des Accords - Tome 4
#. column 0: copy of the <i>Book of Refulgence</i>
#. column 2: copies of the <i>Book of Refulgence</i>
#. column 8: A short apocryphal tome presumably created by Eden for recordkeeping purposes.<br><br>Copies of the same Eden's Verse apocrypha can be traded for special gear.
msgctxt "Item:29030:0:9"
msgid "Book of Refulgence"
msgstr "Книга сияния"

#. ja: 古びた剣【共】
#. de: Schwert[p] der Antike
#. fr: épée antique des Accords
#. column 2: blades of golden antiquity
#. column 8: A golden blade forged by some ancient civilization, recovered from Eden's Verse. Though such weapons were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up and they are now essentially worthless.
#. column 9: Blade of Golden Antiquity
msgctxt "Item:29031:0:0"
msgid "blade of golden antiquity"
msgstr "клинок древности"

#. de: Schwerter[p] der Antike
#. fr: épées antiques des Accords
#. column 0: blade of golden antiquity
#. column 8: A golden blade forged by some ancient civilization, recovered from Eden's Verse. Though such weapons were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up and they are now essentially worthless.
#. column 9: Blade of Golden Antiquity
msgctxt "Item:29031:0:2"
msgid "blades of golden antiquity"
msgstr "клинки древности"

#. ja: エデン空間で入手した謎めいた剣。<br>かつて熱心に収集する好事家がいたが流行は過ぎ去り、今や取引する者はいない
#. de: Ein goldenes Schwert, das von einer antiken Zivilisation angefertigt und in Eden gefunden wurde. Einst rissen sich Sammler förmlich nach dieser Rarität, doch heutzutage findet man dafür keine Abnehmer mehr.
#. fr: Une mystérieuse épée récupérée lors de l'inspection d'Éden et du Grand Vide. Même si les col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neurs se les arrachaient autrefois, elles ont depuis perdu en popularité, et plus personne ne les rachète.
#. column 0: blade of golden antiquity
#. column 2: blades of golden antiquity
#. column 9: Blade of Golden Antiquity
msgctxt "Item:29031:0:8"
msgid "A golden blade forged by some ancient civilization, recovered from Eden's Verse. Though such weapons were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up and they are now essentially worthless."
msgstr "Золотой клинок, выкованный древней цивилизацией и найденный в Эдеме. Когда-то за такое оружие давали немалые деньги, но мода прошла, и теперь оно никому не нужно."

