#. ja: モーエンの手形:奇譚
#. de: Mowen-Marke[p] „Fantastik“
#. fr: avoir de Mowen (fabuleux)
#. column 2: Mowen's tokens (allegory)
#. column 8: A note of promise received from Mowen for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of allegory. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed.
#. column 9: Mowen's Token (Allegory)
msgctxt "Item:29035:0:0"
msgid "Mowen's token (allegory)"
msgstr "знак Моуэн (иносказание)"

#. de: Mowen-Marken[p] „Fantastik“
#. fr: avoirs de Mowen (fabuleux)
#. column 0: Mowen's token (allegory)
#. column 8: A note of promise received from Mowen for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of allegory. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed.
#. column 9: Mowen's Token (Allegory)
msgctxt "Item:29035:0:2"
msgid "Mowen's tokens (allegory)"
msgstr "знаки Моуэн (иносказание)"

#. ja: アラガントームストーン:奇譚を納品した証となる商人モーエンの手形だった紙切れ。<br>引き換え期限が終了し、今や取引には利用できない
#. de: Von Mowen für die Abgabe Allagischer Steine der Fantastik ausgegebene Bestätigungsmarke. Der Handel mit diesen Marken wurde beendet. Sie können daher nicht mehr eingetauscht werden.
#. fr: Cet avoir atteste que vous avez remis à Mowen des mémoquartz allagois fabuleux. Il pouvait être échangé contre des équipements de grande qualité, mais n'est désormais plus valable.
#. column 0: Mowen's token (allegory)
#. column 2: Mowen's tokens (allegory)
#. column 9: Mowen's Token (Allegory)
msgctxt "Item:29035:0:8"
msgid "A note of promise received from Mowen for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of allegory. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed."
msgstr "Обещанный Моуэн знак за сдачу аллаганских камней иносказаний. Но Дом великолепия изменил правила, и теперь от этой бумажки толку меньше, чем от листа, на котором она написана."

#. ja: モーエンの手形:奇譚
