msgid "Mowen's Token (Allegory)"
msgstr "Знак Моуэн (иносказание)"

#. ja: 超耐久型トームストーン
#. de: hochfest[a] Allagisch[a] Stein
#. fr: mémoquartz ultrarésistant
#. column 2: perdurable tomestones
#. column 8: A rare and beautiful tomestone made of nigh-indestructible fused quartz. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
#. column 9: Perdurable Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:29036:0:0"
msgid "perdurable tomestone"
msgstr "сверхпрочный камень"

#. de: hochfest[a] Allagisch[a] Steine
