msgstr "куски превосходной куркумы"

#. ja: 染料の材料としても使えるスパイス<br>[友好部族クエスト：キタリ族専用]<br>※このアイテムは採集手帳には記録されません。
#. de: Aus Gelbwurz stellen die Grabenden Pfoten ein kräftiges Färbemittel her. (Für Aufträge des Freundesvolks der Qitari.)<br><br>※ Nicht im Sammler-Notizbuch vorhanden.
#. fr: Un curcuma de Rak'tika utilisé pour fabriquer des vêtements.<br>[Réservé aux quêtes des Qitari]<br>[Non répertorié dans le carnet de récolte]
#. column 0: lump of splendid turmeric
#. column 2: lumps of splendid turmeric
#. column 9: Splendid Turmeric
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:29551:0:8"
msgid "Through the work of masters in the ways of spice, this root of decidedly unremarkable appearance is transformed into a bright-orange powder. This would make for a rather impressive magic trick, were it not for the fact the process takes several days to complete, which is somewhat longer than the attention span of the average audience.<br><br>※Only for use in Qitari society quests.<br>※Not included in the gathering log."
msgstr "Мастера пряностей превращают этот невзрачный корень в ярко-оранжевый порошок. Было бы похоже на настоящий фокус, если бы на всё про всё не уходило несколько дней — куда дольше, чем средний зритель способен сохранять интерес.<br><br>※Только для заданий народа Кхотерл.<br>※Не отображается в журнале собирателя."

#. ja: 発掘隊向けのターメリック
#. de: Gelbwurz
#. fr: Curcuma forestier
#. column 0: lump of splendid turmeric
#. column 2: lumps of splendid turmeric
#. column 8: Through the work of masters in the ways of spice, this root of decidedly unremarkable appearance is transformed into a bright-orange powder. This would make for a rather impressive magic trick, were it not for the fact the process takes several days to complete, which is somewhat longer than the attention span of the average audience.<br><br>※Only for use in Qitari society quests.<br>※Not included in the gathering log.
msgctxt "Item:29551:0:9"
msgid "Splendid Turmeric"
msgstr "Превосходная куркума"

#. ja: 発掘隊向けのマリモ
#. de: Marimo-Mooskugel
#. fr: marimo forestière
#. column 2: splendid marimo
#. column 8: While even the most scholarly of scholars struggle to identify exactly what this mysterious aquatic substance actually <i>is</i>, the Qitari have discovered it to be incredibly useful in the removal of unwanted odors. A few scrubs with a marimo produces a distinctive pond-like fragrance, which is many magnitudes more pleasant than what Qitari usually smell of, which does not bear description.<br><br>※Only for use in Qitari society quests.<br>※Not included in the gathering log.
#. column 9: Splendid Marimo
msgctxt "Item:29552:0:0"
msgid "splendid marimo"
msgstr "превосходный маримо"

#. de: Marimo-Mooskugeln
#. fr: marimos forestières
#. column 0: splendid marimo
