#. fr: plume de volaille forestière
#. column 2: splendid tarichuk feathers
#. column 8: Fortunately, the former owner was kind enough to molt this fine feather for you to collect without the need to resort to bloodshed, which may explain how it retains its natural splendidness.<br><br>※Only for use in Qitari society quests.<br>※Not included in the gathering log.
