#. fr: poignée d'armoise forestière
#. column 2: sprigs of splendid mugwort
#. column 8: Few would suspect that such an innocuous plant could be used in the production of explosives. Culinarians are investigating the connection between its combustive properties and claims that the consumption of mugwort causes indigestion.<br><br>※Only for use in Qitari society quests.<br>※Not included in the gathering log.
