msgstr "Рыботорговец"

#. ja: ミスリルソブリン
#. de: Mithril-Souverän
#. fr: souverain de mithril
#. column 2: mythril sovereigns
#. column 8: Known for its beautifully shimmering scales, which are in contrast to its rather lackluster meat.<br><br>[Suitable for display in aquariums tier 2 and higher.]<br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
