#. ja: レックドクロス
#. de: Treibholzgleiter
#. fr: voile de l'épave
#. column 2: shipwreck's sails
#. column 8: This wavekin is so broad and flat that it has been compared to the sail of a ship left to float on the tide. In actuality, it is waiting for seabirds to pick the parasites from its flanks.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Shipwreck's Sail
msgctxt "Item:29759:0:0"
msgid "shipwreck's sail"
msgstr "парус кораблекрушения"

