#. de: groß[a] Ätherlaus
#. fr: superpou d'éther
#. column 2: hi-aetherlice
#. column 8: An aetherially charged wavekin that has a habit of appearing when one least expects or wants it.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Hi-aetherlouse
msgctxt "Item:29761:0:0"
msgid "hi-aetherlouse"
msgstr "высшая эфирная вошь"

#. de: groß[a] Ätherläuse
#. fr: superpoux d'éther
#. column 0: hi-aetherlouse
