msgid "Coral Seadragon"
msgstr "Коралловый морской дракон"

#. ja: ロガサウルス
#. de: Schurkosaurus
#. fr: roguesaurus
#. column 2: roguesaurs
#. column 8: Named after the river rather than the traditional Lominsan profession. Those unfortunate enough to encounter one will testify that to describe it as roguish would be an understatement, and that “murderous,” “man-eating,” and “malevolent” would all be more applicable adjectives.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on extra large canvases.]
#. column 9: Roguesaurus
msgctxt "Item:29765:0:0"
msgid "roguesaurus"
msgstr "рогозавр"

#. de: Schurkosaurier
#. fr: roguesaurus
#. column 0: roguesaurus
#. column 8: Named after the river rather than the traditional Lominsan profession. Those unfortunate enough to encounter one will testify that to describe it as roguish would be an understatement, and that “murderous,” “man-eating,” and “malevolent” would all be more applicable adjectives.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on extra large canvases.]
#. column 9: Roguesaurus
msgctxt "Item:29765:0:2"
msgid "roguesaurs"
msgstr "рогозавры"

#. ja: 幻海流中に棲息する獰猛な甲鱗綱<br>メルトール海峡南の稀少魚<br>[魚拓額縁G4に設定可能]
#. de: Ein gigantisches, angriffslustiges Reptil, das in den Phantomströmungen der südlichen Straße von Merlthor lauert. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe XL ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Un reptile féroce qui vit dans les courants spectraux.<br>Rarissime, on l'aperçoit parfois vers le détroit sud de Merlthor.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de très grande taille]
#. column 0: roguesaurus
#. column 2: roguesaurs
#. column 9: Roguesaurus
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:29765:0:8"
msgid "Named after the river rather than the traditional Lominsan profession. Those unfortunate enough to encounter one will testify that to describe it as roguish would be an understatement, and that “murderous,” “man-eating,” and “malevolent” would all be more applicable adjectives.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on extra large canvases.]"
msgstr "Назван в честь реки, а не традиционного лимсийского ремесла. Те, кому не повезло встретить эту рыбу, подтвердят: «разбойная» — слишком мягкое слово. Куда больше ей подходят «убийственная», «людоедская» и «злобная».<br><br>[Можно выставить в очень большой раме с рыбным рисунком.]"

#. ja: ロガサウルス
#. de: Schurkosaurus
#. fr: Roguesaurus
#. column 0: roguesaurus
#. column 2: roguesaurs
#. column 8: Named after the river rather than the traditional Lominsan profession. Those unfortunate enough to encounter one will testify that to describe it as roguish would be an understatement, and that “murderous,” “man-eating,” and “malevolent” would all be more applicable adjectives.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on extra large canvases.]
msgctxt "Item:29765:0:9"
msgid "Roguesaurus"
msgstr "Рогозавр"

#. ja: マーマンヘアー
#. de: Mama Haarlos
#. fr: crinière de triton
#. column 2: merman's manes
#. column 8: Though the existence of mermen is much debated, if any were to exist, they would no doubt object to the comparisons drawn between their long locks and the tentacles of this grotesque cephalopod.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Merman's Mane
msgctxt "Item:29766:0:0"
msgid "merman's mane"
msgstr "грива морского мужика"

#. de: Mama Haarlos
#. fr: crinières de triton
#. column 0: merman's mane
#. column 8: Though the existence of mermen is much debated, if any were to exist, they would no doubt object to the comparisons drawn between their long locks and the tentacles of this grotesque cephalopod.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Merman's Mane
msgctxt "Item:29766:0:2"
msgid "merman's manes"
msgstr "гривы морского мужика"

#. ja: 船乗りに人魚の頭部とあだ名される大型の頭足類<br>ガラディオン湾沖合の稀少魚<br>[魚拓額縁G2に設定可能]
#. de: Fischer bezeichnen diesen Kopffüßer, der überraschende Ähnlichkeit mit einem Hyurankopf aufweist, als „Mama Haarlos“. Es ist eine seltene Spezies, die vor allem in den Gewässern der Galadion-Bucht vorkommt. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe M ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Un grand céphalopode que les marins se plaisent à comparer à la tête d'un triton.<br>Rarissime, on l'aperçoit parfois au large de la baie de Galadion.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de taille moyenne]
#. column 0: merman's mane
#. column 2: merman's manes
#. column 9: Merman's Mane
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:29766:0:8"
msgid "Though the existence of mermen is much debated, if any were to exist, they would no doubt object to the comparisons drawn between their long locks and the tentacles of this grotesque cephalopod.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]"
msgstr "Существование морских мужиков вызывает немало споров. Но будь они реальны, им наверняка не понравилось бы, что их длинные волосы сравнивают со щупальцами этого жуткого головоногого.<br><br>[Можно выставить в средней раме с рыбным рисунком.]"

#. ja: マーマンヘアー
#. de: Mama Haarlos
