msgstr "Настоящий баррамунди"

#. ja: モッピィビアード
#. de: tanzend[a] Zupfbart
#. fr: barbe-trempée
#. column 2: mopbeards
#. column 8: Lifting it above the waterline causes it to transform from an elegant oceanic beauty to something resembling...well, a mop.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
