#. ja: ザ・チョッパー
#. de: Exemplar[p] von Hans dem Klipper
#. fr: Bartholomew l'équarrisseur
#. column 2: Bartholomew the Choppers
#. column 8: Suspected by some to be the reincarnation of an unhinged murderer, although it is also known to have a more amiable side. Well, about as amiable as one can expect from a wavekin that revels in killing.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Bartholomew the Chopper
msgctxt "Item:29777:0:0"
msgid "Bartholomew the Chopper"
msgstr "Варфоломей Палач"

