#. ja: シャーラタンサバイバー
#. de: Scharlatanschere
#. fr: survivant charlatan
#. column 2: charlatan survivors
#. column 8: At first glance, the charlatan survivor may appear to be a well-armored crustacean, but the outer shell is merely a purloined disguise concealing a much smaller creature beneath. Luckily, predatory wavekin are quite easily deceived and often choose to leave it alone in order to pursue less chitinous prey.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
