#. ja: 第二次復興用の脚立
#. de: Genist-Trittleiter
#. fr: escabeau de restauration (2e phase)
#. column 2: grade 2 skybuilders' stepladders
#. column 8: Unlike most other items requested by the skybuilders, this one actually seems to serve some practical purpose. It can even be carried on one shoulder, allowing the bearer to pivot quickly, which leads to all sorts of hilarity as their colleagues attempt, often in vain, to avoid having their skull cracked.
#. column 9: Grade 2 Skybuilders' Stepladder
msgctxt "Item:29816:0:0"
msgid "grade 2 skybuilders' stepladder"
msgstr "стремянка небесных строителей II"

