msgid "Grade 2 Skybuilders' Stepladder"
msgstr "Стремянка небесных строителей II"

#. ja: 第二次復興用の大鋸
#. de: Genist-Säge
#. fr: grande scie de restauration (2e phase)
#. column 2: grade 2 skybuilders' crosscut saws
#. column 8: The sound it makes as it cleaves through timber is akin to that of a person snoring. One particular linguist even went so far as to investigate a possible connection between the words “sawing” and “snoring,” and to no one's surprise but her own, discovered that nothing of the sort exists.
#. column 9: Grade 2 Skybuilders' Crosscut Saw
msgctxt "Item:29817:0:0"
msgid "grade 2 skybuilders' crosscut saw"
msgstr "поперечная пила небесных строителей II"

