#. ja: 第二次復興用のシチュー
#. de: Topf[p] Genist-Eintopf
#. fr: marmite de ragoût de restauration (2e phase)
#. column 2: pots of grade 2 skybuilders' stew
#. column 8: The term “potluck” applies perfectly to this particular dish, as it is traditionally assembled from whatever the chef can dig up from an often poorly lit pantry. The fact that rats tend to squeak and wriggle a fair bit when picked up is probably all that prevents them from being added to the mix. The dead ones, on the other hand...
#. column 9: Grade 2 Skybuilders' Stew
msgctxt "Item:29831:0:0"
msgid "pot of grade 2 skybuilders' stew"
msgstr "котелок рагу небесных строителей II"

