#. fr: commode sur commande de restauration (2e phase)
#. column 2: grade 2 artisanal skybuilders' wardrobes
#. column 8: If, for any reason, one has the need to hide inside, such as the unexpected return of one of the residents and so on, the air holes provided should prevent untimely suffocation. Not that there is such a thing as “timely suffocation.”
