msgstr "Обжигает даже на ощупь — таскать его то ещё удовольствие.<br><br>Можно добыть только во время умбральной огненной вспышки.<br><br>Используется в сложных рецептах."

#. ja: 第二次復興用の幻火岩【検】
#. de: Inspizierter Genist-Feuerseelenstein
#. fr: Roche des flammes évanescentes de restauration expertisée (2e phase)
#. column 0: approved grade 2 skybuilders' umbral flarestone
#. column 2: approved grade 2 skybuilders' umbral flarestones
#. column 8: Red-hot to the touch, which makes it a bastard to carry.<br><br>Can only be gathered during an umbral flare.<br><br>Used in expert crafting recipes.
msgctxt "Item:29892:0:9"
msgid "Approved Grade 2 Skybuilders' Umbral Flarestone"
msgstr "Камень огненной вспышки небесных строителей II разряда"

#. ja: 第二次復興用の幻雷石【検】
#. de: inspiziert[a] Genist-Donnerseelenstein
#. fr: cristal des foudres évanescentes de restauration expertisé (2e phase)
#. column 2: approved grade 2 skybuilders' umbral levinshards
#. column 8: If you thought catching lightning in a bottle was difficult, catching it in a crystal fragment is even trickier. At least a bottle comes with a handy cap to keep in said lightning when caught, whereas crystal relies on nothing more than the bolt's willing cooperation.<br><br>Can only be gathered during umbral levin.<br><br>Used in expert crafting recipes.
#. column 9: Approved Grade 2 Skybuilders' Umbral Levinshard
msgctxt "Item:29893:0:0"
msgid "approved grade 2 skybuilders' umbral levinshard"
msgstr "Осколок молнии небесных строителей II разряда"

