#. ja: 第二次復興用のクラウドスキッパー
#. de: Genist-Wolkenskipper
#. fr: gobie vogue-nuage de restauration (2e phase)
#. column 2: grade 2 skybuilders' cloudskippers
#. column 8: True to its name, this rare species spends its entire life in the firmament (the actual firmament, not the place in Ishgard) where it skips from cloud to cloud. Sadly, its ability to remain airborne relies on the presence of said clouds, without which it falls inelegantly to the ground below.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide.
#. column 9: Grade 2 Skybuilders' Cloudskipper
msgctxt "Item:29994:0:0"
msgid "grade 2 skybuilders' cloudskipper"
msgstr "Небесный прыгун II ступени для мастеров небесного строительства"

