#. ja: 第二次復興用のクァールフィッシュ
#. de: Genist-Coeurlfisch
#. fr: poisson coeurl de restauration (2e phase)
#. column 2: grade 2 skybuilders' coeurlfish
#. column 8: Coeurlfish fall into the category of species that anglers would rather not have thrashing at the end of their line, and many would rather lose their lure than face its vicious fangs. Only those with nerves of steel would attempt to reel in one of these aquatic abominations, though they are often made to regret it.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide.
